      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hermanville%2C_Mississippi",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "In the early 1960s, a Hermanville lumber mill produced 10 million board feet of high‑quality southern pine each year.",
